Sail Sedona Extension proof of concept

This package includes native Apache SedonaDB code from the Apache Software
Foundation, commit 0a1993d9be8bcf52150593ad08fc6a3412d50f29, modified only by the
distributed patches/datafusion-55.patch to build against the declared DataFusion
and Arrow versions. Apache SedonaDB is licensed under Apache-2.0; see
LICENSE-SEDONADB and NOTICE-SEDONADB.

The checked macOS wheel bundles dynamically linked GEOS 3.14.1 libraries.
GEOS is licensed under LGPL-2.1-or-later; see LICENSE-GEOS. Its corresponding
source release is https://download.osgeo.org/geos/geos-3.14.1.tar.bz2.

This example is a Sail extension prototype, not an Apache SedonaDB release.
